      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'll note a possible allergy, unconfirmed. Now, here's what I think. With a sister diagnosed, loose pale stools, bloating and tiredness, this could well be coeliac disease.",
